00:49:40,280 --> 00:49:42,160
All right, now for the French connection game

228
00:49:42,160 --> 00:49:43,400
gets a little more interesting.

229
00:49:43,400 --> 00:49:50,760
So there, again, we can show criminal, followed by the cop.

230
00:49:50,760 --> 00:49:55,040
And then we go and we show, here's the third possibility.

231
00:49:55,040 --> 00:49:59,880
So they can go on or off, on or off.

