244
00:50:34,800 --> 00:50:35,400
who knows this.

245
00:50:35,400 --> 00:50:40,480
So you just need to do it the conventional way for clarity.

246
00:50:40,480 --> 00:50:42,360
So anyway, this is always player one there.

247
00:50:42,360 --> 00:50:44,240
That's always player two.

248
00:50:44,240 --> 00:50:46,920
Every time I've ever seen it, it's been that way.

249
00:50:46,920 --> 00:50:50,560
So you should do it the same way.

