01:55:04,180 --> 01:55:07,300
was what game theory was adopted to address.

374
01:55:07,300 --> 01:55:09,060
Because notice, with Nash equilibrium,

375
01:55:09,060 --> 01:55:11,100
no one is ever thinking ahead and saying, well,

376
01:55:11,100 --> 01:55:12,700
if I change, then he'll do something different,

