01:75:32,900 --> 01:75:34,060
despite all this logic,

387
01:75:34,060 --> 01:75:35,920
in the real world soft bargaining actually is

388
01:75:35,920 --> 01:75:40,480
on average a better strategy, because so many human attitudes

389
01:75:40,480 --> 01:75:42,740
for a strategy are reformed during,

390
01:75:42,740 --> 01:75:45,760
