396
01:75:55,760 --> 01:75:58,140
But in the real world, almost of that,

397
01:75:58,140 --> 01:75:59,940
most of that benefit has gone away.

398
01:75:59,940 --> 01:76:01,540
We're dealing with strangers all the time

399
01:76:01,540 --> 01:76:02,720
