402
01:76:06,020 --> 01:76:07,400
They don't, they're never going to remember us.

403
01:76:07,400 --> 01:76:08,340
We'll never see them again.

404
01:76:08,340 --> 01:76:11,600
In a world like that, actually, you want to be the,

