431
01:77:19,700 --> 01:77:22,720
So anyway, so, but the general intuition

432
01:77:22,720 --> 01:77:24,920
of which strategy is the good strategy,

433
01:77:25,240 --> 01:77:28,220
the obvious answer is neither is the good strategy.

434
01:77:28,220 --> 01:77:30,420
It all depends upon the mix in the population,

435
01:77:30,780 --> 01:77:33,980
and in equilibrium, the martial person is doing equally well,

436
01:77:33,980 --> 01:77:35,220
either way, right?

