01:78:13,040 --> 01:78:15,660
You could actually get an A while doing almost no work.

455
01:78:16,860 --> 01:78:18,360
But I don't want to let you do that.

456
01:78:18,820 --> 01:78:21,060
So when I am writing, when I'm writing the questions,

457
01:78:21,060 --> 01:78:23,240
I'm there thinking, okay, I need to be unpredictable now.

