483
01:79:19,860 --> 01:79:21,920
Where again, like in that Popeye criminal thing,

484
01:79:21,920 --> 01:79:25,000
you might start saying, well, he thinks that I think,

485
01:79:25,000 --> 01:79:27,500
that he thinks that I think, that he thinks that I think,

