01:80:04,440 --> 01:80:08,560
Like so, how many steps down of advanced reasoning

3
01:80:08,560 --> 01:80:10,300
that people do, right?

4
01:80:10,300 --> 01:80:11,520
Or let's flip it this way.

5
01:80:11,520 --> 01:80:15,100
There is a number to assume that will maximize your payoff.

6
01:80:16,240 --> 01:80:18,480
Because in general, if you assume infinite,

7
01:80:18,480 --> 01:80:20,880
like other people are doing an infinite number of steps,

8
01:80:21,220 --> 01:80:22,600
you will actually do very poorly

9
01:80:22,600 --> 01:80:23,920
because your prediction will be way off

10
01:80:23,920 --> 01:80:25,740
because normal human beings don't do infinite steps.

11
01:80:26,680 --> 01:80:28,020
On the other hand, if you do no steps,

12
01:80:28,020 --> 01:80:29,260
then often you'll generally do poorly

13
01:80:29,260 --> 01:80:30,860
because most people are strategic to some degree.

14
01:80:31,940 --> 01:80:33,400
So, at least for some games,

15
01:80:33,400 --> 01:80:36,280
people have actually tried to measure how many levels

